WEBVTT

00:00:58.676 --> 00:01:02.396
And as climate changes in Oslo,

00:01:02.436 --> 00:01:05.956
we are likely to experience
more heavy rain.

00:01:05.956 --> 00:01:10.476
So we need to improve
our storm water runoff system,

00:01:10.516 --> 00:01:13.076
and opening creeks and rivers

00:01:13.116 --> 00:01:15.476
will help the city
to become more resilient

00:01:15.516 --> 00:01:16.836
and avoid flooding,

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:19.916
as well as creating nicer areas

00:01:19.916 --> 00:01:23.956
and contributing
to biodiversity in the city.

00:01:24.516 --> 00:01:29.076
Klosterenga is close to being
a zero-emission construction site

00:01:29.116 --> 00:01:31.196
run by the city of Oslo.